Our files in this folder (the build scripts, pins, patches and brand files in
build/, the config, the Kotlin hooks and the docs) are part of PhoneCanDo and
are licensed under the PhoneCanDo Source-Available License. See the root
LICENSE file: ../../../LICENSE

Our patches stay under that licence when they are built into the opencode
payload (liboc-engine.so, liboc-opentui.so). Section 10 of that licence lets
you modify the payload for your own use, including relinking it with changed
versions of the LGPL libraries in it.

opencode and opentui themselves are MIT, and the payload also carries Bun and
the libraries it links; NOTICE.md lists them and points to their entries in
../../../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
